SUMMARY:The Lemonheads
LOCATION:Troxy
DESCRIPTION:VENUE PRESALE: WEDS 5TH NOV @ 10AM GENERAL SALE: FRI 7TH NOV @ 
 
10AM Since they were formed in Boston\, Mass\, in 1986 by Evan Dando\, the 
 
family tree of The Lemonheads has had many twisted tentacles and tangential
 
 branches\, and a host of one-liners etched into its bark. Anyone could be 
 
a Lemonhead but for how long who knows? Leastways they?ll be shoulder-to-sh
 
oulder with Evan throwing discordant chords against alt-country-tinged melo
 
dies\, playing that light and dark card. The Lemonheads? arcane adventure c
 
ontinues with ?Love Chant? set for release later this year. Sparring with g
 
uest guitarists J Mascis from Dinosaur Jr and The Bevis Frond?s Nick Saloma
 
n\, Evan the songwriter remains gloriously astute. The voice is lower and m
 
ore brooding but the mood is pinprick sharp and the social commentary as ba
 
rbed as ever. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.co.uk/the-lemonheads
 
-london-02-10-2026/event/3E00649D8323135A
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.co.uk/the-lemonheads-london-02-10-2026/event/3
 
E00649D8323135A
END:VEVENT
